ght or wrong here. Nice recitation and creative animation", "timestamp": 1794168432, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "pankajandbaranwal", "author_id": "257226957", "id": "18131135983695909", "text": "Galat story hai. Lakshmi ji behen thi bali ki. And vachan bhi jo maanga bali ne vo bhi galat bata rhe hain aap.", "timestamp": 1793970672, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_droy_xd", "author_id": "47980689690", "id": "17991359199070890", "text": "Salute to bali 🙌", "timestamp": 1793945325, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "bob01013", "author_id": "4587924449", "id": "18105439181142841", "text": "This is also the reason Why Onam is celebrated right? Mahabali comes to meet his Kingdom citizens. And Raja Mahabali was Asur, Daitya is a lower designation for him.", "timestamp": 1793858547, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "pvt_hid_203", "author_id": "56195025004", "id": "17911338990579138", "text": "Wrong story and sources", "timestamp": 1793762555, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "devanshu.motion", "author_id": "25176808901", "id": "18454165201121928", "text": "Source: Skanda Purana, Vaishnava Khanda, Kartik Mahatmya, adhyay 9 (Bali ka vardaan shlok 51-54, kaid se mukti shlok 77, kamal mein Lakshmi ji shlok 80). Vaman aur Bali ki katha Shrimad Bhagavatam 8.15-8.22 se. Bhagavatam mein devta swarg chhodkar chale jaate hain, kaid ka zikr Skanda Purana mein hai. Ram ji ka swagat aur Diwali ka rishta parampara se aata hai.", "timestamp": 1793723070, "like_count": 16}, {"author": "chouhan_rahul_rj22", "author_id": "32832199256", "id": "17954182332337674", "text": "Galat kahani Bata rahe ho aap Lakshmi Ji ko Raja Bali Ne kabhi kaid nahin kiya tha Lakshmi Ji Raja Bali ki bahan lagti Hai", "timestamp": 1793721252, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "chouhan_rahul_rj22", "author_id": "32832199256", "id": "18114298508616704", "text": "Galat kahani bata rahe ho aap", "timestamp": 1793721083, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ram6555992", "author_id": "35323438349", "id": "17952737817346236", "text": "🔥🔥", "timestamp": 1793717437, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "free__fire__lover__ak_47__", "author_id": "58295687506", "id": "18411383524091070", "text": "Jay shree Ram ji 🙏🙏🙏", "timestamp": 1793712535, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "debakalpabumba", "author_id": "2099837734", "id": "18232017220330206", "text": "Bali was asur not daitya", "timestamp": 1793705695, "like_count": 38}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfPwgGNSbNk/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfPwgGNSbNk", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/891981515_18130811404832902_1992925533927668814_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMTY0NjMwNDE4NjMxNTYyMDE4MTMwODExMzk4ODMyOTAy.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjU0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl91cGxvYWRlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=gI_IvtYwUuEQ7kNvwHkmSMR&_nc_oc=AdqCRYfjyZ8CVtR3TGCVsWu4gjLDmJ9e7Y3vLHCFuGBixKwvbnDPjaQaXfihz7cKGxncsBDmsc8B-rOi9xjOAD84&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna&_nc_gid=gK4wQ7TKHHsJ3L1HG09NWw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQTlbhLTL3-uD2-aBmc5pJeNGY_9mkzwkfCyXvYh5L_Knw&oe=6AF8348B", "display_id": "DfPwgGNSbNk", "fulltitle": "Video by devanshu.motion", "upload_date": "20261102", "epoch": 1794266533, "format": "dash-1687528246068054v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-1687527642734781a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-1687528246068054v+dash-1687527642734781a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 1472.329, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 1404.153, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 68.176, "asr": 44100, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.10.26", "release_git_head": "c91f8de0bfb3577894abad716eaaa01659e6bd14", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}